Gameplay
========

Gameplay is a modified fork of GameNative:
https://github.com/utkarshdalal/GameNative

GameNative and its contributors retain copyright in their original work.
Gameplay modifications are distributed under the GNU General Public License,
version 3, as provided in the accompanying LICENSE file.

Notable modifications include a new user interface and theming system, local
Windows executable and installer import, expanded controller support,
cross-store library awareness, adaptive display resolution, battery warnings,
and coordinated downloads across supported stores.

Modified work: 2026, Gameplay contributors.

The Android application continues to use the internal `app.gamenative`
namespace for data, upgrade, JNI, and native-component compatibility. This
technical identifier is not the displayed product name.

Additional component-specific notices and source offers are in
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES. No original copyright or license notice is revoked by
the Gameplay name change.
